      "writtenOn": "2025-04-11T21:19:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This feature should be guarded with CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_SYSTEM_UNLOCKED because we explicitly bypassed test coverage for this feature.\nThe firmware qualification tests verify that `CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_SYSTEM_UNLOCKED\u003dn`, so we can\u0027t turn this on by default or we\u0027ll see failures.  Because this CL modifies brox files, it could be accidentally cherry-picked to the FW branch.\n\nI confirmed we have brox models in the lab, so I think it\u0027s best that developers turn this feature on with a local build only.\n\nIt makes sense to enable this for fatcat, as that project is still in the early stages and needs to do experiments with PDC firmware.",
      "parentUuid": "84a9c52b_54d96ef4",
